      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تمايطوا</span></b>  <i>They removed, retired, went to a
distance,</i> or <i>became remote, one from another;
and their mutual state became bad, disordered,</i> or
<i>disturbed;</i> (S, K;) contr. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهايطوا</span>. (Fr, S, in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هيط</span>.)

